Spoiler follows


How to avoid overeating when trying to get capabilities?  I used to choke
to death eating dragons and giants - eating giants gives strength and
resistance to lots of stuff - eating dragons has been discussed at length.
Now a tinning kit comes in massively handy - eating a tin of dragon meat
or giant meat has the same effect as eating the whole thing - and you don't
become completely full.

Note that you don't have to be able to pick something up to tin it, and
tinned stuff doesn't spoil.  You will find a tinning
kit about as often as you find a stethiscope (sp?), or you can get it
through any of the various methods for obtaining such things (polymorph,
wish if you have lots, etc).

